  "text": "## Template 1: Account Opening Confirmation  \n**Subject:** Your FirstUK Bank Account Is Ready! 🎉  \n```\nDear [Customer Name],\n\nYour SmartSaver account with FirstUK Bank is now open and ready to use.\n\nAccount Details:\n- Account Number: [ACC-XXXXX]\n- Sort Code: 20-00-00\n- Current Balance: £[amount]\n\nWhat's Next:\n1. Log in at www.firstuk.bank/login\n2. Set up Two-Factor Authentication for security\n3. Make your first deposit (transfer, branch, or standing order)\n4. Download our mobile app for easy access\n\nYour Current Rate:\nBased on your balance, you're earning 4.50% AER on your SmartSaver.\nYour first interest payment will arrive at the end of this month.\n\nQuestions?\n- Phone: 0800-555-2265\n- Email: support@firstuk.bank\n- Website: www.firstuk.bank/faq\n\nWelcome to FirstUK Bank! We're delighted to have you.\n\nBest regards,\nFirstUK Bank Customer Service\n```  \n---",
